   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of Dalits in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dalit Solidarity works for the empowerment of Dalits through whatever means available. We tirelessly advocate for their rights and lobbying for their cause. We have concrete measures to support the education of children, vocational training for the school dropouts and social &amp; developmental projects for widows and the marginalised. We work in the States of Tamil Nadu, Andrapradesh, Odisha and Uttrapradesh</narrative>
  </description>
